{
  "name": "Google News headlines to Google Sheets every morning",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Google News headlines to Google Sheets every morning\n\nEvery morning, fetch Google News headlines for your topics, with source, date, link and summary, and append the rows to a Google Sheet.\n\n### Setup (3 minutes)\n1. **Apify token** - create a free account at apify.com and copy your API token (Settings > API & Integrations).\n   In the **Get Google News** node, create a *Header Auth* credential: name `Authorization`, value `Bearer YOUR_TOKEN`.\n2. **Google Sheets** node - connect your Google account and paste the URL of an empty sheet. Columns are created from the data automatically.\n3. Edit the JSON body of **Get Google News** with your own inputs, then activate the workflow.\n\n**Cost:** $2 per 1,000 articles (see the Actor page). `maxTotalChargeUsd` in the body is a hard cap per run.\nActor: https://apify.com/om_kh/google-news-scraper",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 460
      },
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -540,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "462cecd7-ad28-4aca-9641-3dae51babf2d"
    },
    {
